      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: I was part of the discussion that sparked this canny.\nThe idea was not to make this feature into a \"toy\" but allow for fine-tuning after calibration, as people had trouble getting it just right and kept recalibrating without much success.\nLimiting the possible manual rotation after calibration would make sure it's used for how the discussion originally intended. People just wanted a few extra degrees backwards/forwards and they feel it would've been much more comfortable for them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
