      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Allowing application of adjustments to stack would be helpful here as well.  For example, say if you want a 90 degree turn but can only tilt head 45 degrees, you should be able to do it twice.  That or allow full range rotation (or at the very minimum, up to 90 degrees manual correction).\nThere is a separate button for reset, so why does apply re-apply again from the real orientation?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
